# Compliance Readiness Checklist

Purpose: document the vendor due diligence gate required before the clinic allows the HIPAA-ready scheduling SaaS to process scheduling PHI for the pilot.

Scope:
- Pilot clinic location only.
- Patient scheduling, rescheduling, reminder, staff schedule, audit, and EHR integration workflows.
- Vendor-hosted scheduling SaaS and any vendor subprocessors that may process scheduling PHI.

Status summary:
- Overall readiness: Blocked
- PHI processing: Disabled
- Pilot launch: Blocked pending required evidence and security finding review
- Related requirement: REQ-001
- Related controls: ARD-DEC-001, ARD-DEC-004, ARD-DEC-007, ARD-SEC-001, ARD-SEC-002, ARC-CON-004, ARC-CON-010

